  "phase8": {
    "algorithm": "Shared native lexical admission; ordered residual-inventory beam; required words reserved but may occupy any order position; normalized log10 LM + cheap lexical prior/short-word penalty. No target-aware expansion. One best order per bag and ten bags per word-count bucket.",
    "score_formula": "(sum conditional log10 including EOS + 0.05 sum Zipf - 0.15 count(words<=2 letters)) / word count",
    "limits": "Same 10s per-process deadline; model intake included for ordered search. Native 10000 candidate cap and ordered word-check caps are different work units, not equal-work claims. No competing compilation during captures. OS/background effects uncontrolled.",
